2438
02:11:08,908 --> 02:11:10,008
これ落ちたら行ける？
If I drop down here, can I make it?

2439
02:11:10,208 --> 02:11:10,908
ほ！
Hop!

2440
02:11:11,408 --> 02:11:12,508
おー
Ooh...

2441
02:11:13,308 --> 02:11:16,408
このギリギリな瞬間がたまんねぇのじゃ！
I just love these thrilling, close-call moments!

2442
02:11:16,808 --> 02:11:18,608
よいしょ。え、すごい！
Heave-ho... Wait, awesome!

2443
02:11:19,008 --> 02:11:20,708
わし、柱かも！
I might be a pillar myself!

2444
02:11:21,008 --> 02:11:22,408
何柱になろうかな
I wonder what kind of Pillar I should become...

2445
02:11:24,908 --> 02:11:26,008
炎柱
The Flame Pillar!

2446
02:11:27,408 --> 02:11:28,608
よいしょ、よいしょ
Heave-ho, heave-ho.

2447
02:11:31,408 --> 02:11:32,608
そして
And then...

2448
02:11:33,408 --> 02:11:34,508
そして何？
And then what?

2449
02:11:34,908 --> 02:11:36,208
そして何じゃ？
And then what is it?

2450
02:11:36,408 --> 02:11:38,308
向こうに向けて
Heading towards that side...

2451
02:11:38,508 --> 02:11:40,408
線を引いていくよと
I'll draw a line across, and...

2452
02:11:40,508 --> 02:11:41,408
よいしょ
Heave-ho...

2453
02:11:41,908 --> 02:11:42,708
こうか
Like this?

2454
02:11:44,708 --> 02:11:45,508
よいしょ
Heave-ho.

2455
02:11:46,108 --> 02:11:48,508
へら柱はそぴあなんじゃないの？
Isn't Sopia the Spatula Pillar?

2456
02:11:48,608 --> 02:11:51,508
そぴあがへら柱習得してるんじゃないの？
Hasn't Sopia already mastered being the Spatula Pillar?

2457
02:11:51,508 --> 02:11:52,308
よいしょ
Heave-ho.

2458
02:11:52,408 --> 02:11:53,208
どうじゃ？
How's this?

2459
02:11:53,308 --> 02:11:54,808
これ結構
This is pretty...

2460
02:11:54,908 --> 02:11:55,908
結構
pretty...

2461
02:11:56,008 --> 02:11:58,508
サラマンダーの神建築
Salamander master architecture,

2462
02:11:58,608 --> 02:12:00,008
神建築主なんじゃない？
aren't I a master architect?

2463
02:12:00,308 --> 02:12:02,308
世の後に...
In the future of the world...

2464
02:12:03,408 --> 02:12:05,308
え、ほんとに合ってる？
Eh, is this really right?

2465
02:12:05,408 --> 02:12:06,708
不安になってきた
I'm starting to get anxious.

2466
02:12:07,108 --> 02:12:08,708
あ、まだ全然足りてない
Ah, it's not nearly enough yet.

2467
02:12:09,108 --> 02:12:09,908
よいしょ
Heave-ho.

2468
02:12:11,308 --> 02:12:12,008
ん？
Hmm?

2469
02:12:12,408 --> 02:12:13,408
足りてる？
Is it enough?

2470
02:12:14,008 --> 02:12:15,208
足りてそう
Looks like it's enough.

2471
02:12:16,008 --> 02:12:17,008
こうして
Like this...

2472
02:12:17,508 --> 02:12:18,708
こうして
Like this...

2473
02:12:19,208 --> 02:12:20,308
いける？
Can I reach?

2474
02:12:20,408 --> 02:12:21,308
足りない？
Not enough?

2475
02:12:21,608 --> 02:12:23,408
一マス足りない？
Short by one block?

2476
02:12:24,308 --> 02:12:28,708
え、難しい。あ、でも向こうにハシゴがあるから、向こうから繋げてもいいかも。
Eh, this is tough. Ah, but there's a ladder over there, so maybe I can connect it from that side.

2477
02:12:29,208 --> 02:12:29,908
よいしょ
Heave-ho.

2478
02:12:30,008 --> 02:12:31,008
よいしょ、よいしょ
Heave-ho, heave-ho.

2479
02:12:31,208 --> 02:12:32,508
気を付けて
Be careful...

2480
02:12:32,708 --> 02:12:34,508
落ちないように
Don't fall...

2481
02:12:35,308 --> 02:12:36,408
電身柱
Telegraph Pole Pillar?

2482
02:12:36,708 --> 02:12:37,608
ちょっと
Wait a sec...

2483
02:12:38,008 --> 02:12:39,108
それちょっと
That's a bit...

2484
02:12:40,308 --> 02:12:41,208
よいしょ、よいしょ
Heave-ho, heave-ho.

2485
02:12:41,408 --> 02:12:43,208
あ、でもここにハシゴ置くと
Ah, but if I put a ladder here...

2486
02:12:43,308 --> 02:12:45,508
繋げられなくない？
won't it be impossible to connect?

2487
02:12:46,408 --> 02:12:47,508
じゃ、一旦
Then, for now...

2488
02:12:47,608 --> 02:12:48,508
しゃあないな
it can't be helped.

2489
02:12:48,608 --> 02:12:50,008
一旦しゃあないので
Since it can't be helped for now...

2490
02:12:50,208 --> 02:12:51,808
ここ抜け避けて
Bypassing this spot...

2491
02:12:52,508 --> 02:12:54,208
こうするか
I'll do this.

2492
02:12:55,308 --> 02:12:56,008
のじゃ
Indeed.

2493
02:12:56,108 --> 02:12:57,208
こういうことや
That's how it's done.

2494
02:12:57,408 --> 02:12:58,908
はい、発想の勝利！
Yes! A victory for genius ideas!

2495
02:12:59,208 --> 02:13:00,408
あちちメラ
Achichi Mela,

2496
02:13:00,508 --> 02:13:01,508
発想柱！
the Inspiration Pillar!

2497
02:13:01,608 --> 02:13:02,708
ひらめき柱！
The Flash-of-Genius Pillar!

2498
02:13:03,308 --> 02:13:04,408
いけるのじゃ！
I can do this!

2499
02:13:04,508 --> 02:13:05,308
よいしょ！
Heave-ho!

2500
02:13:05,508 --> 02:13:08,208
よいしょ、よいしょ、よいしょ、よいしょ
Heave-ho, heave-ho, heave-ho, heave-ho...

2501
02:13:09,008 --> 02:13:14,408
よいしょ、よいしょ、よいしょ、よいしょ
Heave-ho, heave-ho, heave-ho, heave-ho...

2502
02:13:15,408 --> 02:13:16,408
この辺か？
Around here?

2503
02:13:17,508 --> 02:13:18,408
なんで？
Why?

2504
02:13:18,708 --> 02:13:20,008
この、この辺か？
A-Around here?

2505
02:13:21,208 --> 02:13:22,408
こ、こうか
L-Like this?

2506
02:13:23,308 --> 02:13:23,908
んで
And then...

2507
02:13:24,008 --> 02:13:25,208
これを
this...

2508
02:13:25,308 --> 02:13:26,608
どかして
remove it...

2509
02:13:26,908 --> 02:13:27,908
の上に行く
and go on top...

2510
02:13:28,008 --> 02:13:28,908
よっし！
Alright!

2511
02:13:29,308 --> 02:13:31,008
よしよしよしよし
Alright, alright, alright, alright...

2512
02:13:31,108 --> 02:13:33,008
わし上手、わし上手かも！
I'm good, I might actually be good at this!

2513
02:13:33,108 --> 02:13:35,008
わし、マイクラいけるかも！
I might actually be good at Minecraft!

2514
02:13:35,108 --> 02:13:36,708
マインクラフターやれるかも！
I might become a true Minecrafter!

2515
02:13:37,308 --> 02:13:39,008
よしよしよし、そして
Alright alright alright, and then...

2516
02:13:39,108 --> 02:13:40,008
ちょっ適当にね
just appropriately...

2517
02:13:40,108 --> 02:13:41,208
適当に潰しつつ
filling in gaps appropriately as I go...

2518
02:13:41,408 --> 02:13:43,708
よいしょ、よいしょ、よいしょ、よいしょ
Heave-ho, heave-ho, heave-ho, heave-ho...

2519
02:13:44,308 --> 02:13:45,208
こうして
Like this...

2520
02:13:46,208 --> 02:13:47,508
できたー！
I did it!

2521
02:13:49,008 --> 02:13:49,908
おうち
Our home!

2522
02:13:50,008 --> 02:13:51,008
おうち
Our home!

2523
02:13:51,408 --> 02:13:52,708
結構おうちかも！
