But I definitely might have put the ladder in the wrong place.

2525
02:13:57,208 --> 02:13:59,008
そういうことも
Things like that...

2526
02:13:59,308 --> 02:14:01,208
起こる
...happen too.

2527
02:14:01,308 --> 02:14:02,708
一旦ここは
For now, here...

2528
02:14:03,008 --> 02:14:04,508
