Clack-clack, clatter...

2530
02:14:07,408 --> 02:14:08,508
ガタンゴトン
Clack-clack, clatter...

2531
02:14:08,708 --> 02:14:09,808
ガタンゴトン
Clack-clack, clatter...

2532
02:14:09,908 --> 02:14:11,008
ガタンゴトン
Clack-clack, clatter...

2533
02:14:11,408 --> 02:14:13,408
ガタンゴトントンガタンゴトン
Clack-clack, clatter-clatter, clack-clack...

2534
02:14:16,208 --> 02:14:17,208
雨だな
